# build, test, test again and build again in one work directory: each run reuses what the
# last one left, the order a test run after a build and a build after a test run once broke. the
# first test run is read through its run_end record in the lines encoding of --report
0 build .
0 test . --report lines | passed=1	failed=0	skipped=0	total=1
0 test . | passed      sequence  1 test
0 build .
